### Old request (backward compatible)
POST http://127.0.0.1:5000/calculate-tax
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "income": 950000
}

### Quick mode
POST http://127.0.0.1:5000/calculate-tax
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "mode": "quick",
  "income": 950000
}

### Detailed mode (same result for now)
POST http://127.0.0.1:5000/calculate-tax
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "mode": "detailed",
  "basic_salary": 600000,
  "hra": 150000,
  "rent_paid": 120000,
  "special_allowance": 100000,
  "bonus": 50000,
  "investment_80c": 100000,
  "investment_80d": 20000
}
